<title>POLAND: PROCHNIK SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.55 MLN.</title>
<headline>PROCHNIK SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.55 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> SEPTEMBER		1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.55 vs   0.76</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.55 vs   1.10</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.94 vs   1.32</p>
<p> Sales		   10.43 vs   8.48</p>
<p> JANUARY-SEPTEMBER    1996	1995</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.08 vs   1.19 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.08 vs   1.53 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.50 vs   3.22</p>
<p> Sales		   39.43 vs  38.51</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Prochnik SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
